ions, cost, outcomes. No private chain-of-thought required. Trajectory observations may carry versioned, evidence-backed failure classifications where supported: behavioral defect, evidence/proof defect, custody/identity defect, tooling/publication defect, process-instruction adherence, genuine authority required, false/escalated authority request, and provider-capacity interruption. Classification describes observed evidence and does not itself declare a verdict.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",1005,1011]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-030\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"94fe34d93ba5c6417da9c6dedcbe5508180d65bb0cf350683537ca682e208aec\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P4 Derive durable Quality Evidence from trajectories; raw observation and learned hypothesis remain distinct. Derived evidence identifies its source trajectory/schema version and explicit evidence inputs. Where facts permit, aggregate metrics reconcile against those sources, including verifier cycles, RETURN_TO_IMPLEMENT, classified rejections, authority decisions, attributable human-blocked duration, candidate/merge identity, final verdict/landed/DONE and timestamp relationships. UNKNOWN or partial telemetry is never silently converted to zero. Contradictory derived evidence fails deterministic consistency verification. The deterministic consistency verification must itself carry discriminating negative-control / proven-red evidence where practical: altering a derived count, substituting zero for UNKNOWN telemetry without evidence, or introducing an impossible timestamp relation must cause the applicable check to fail. A consistency check that cannot fail is not evidence (SWF-24). Folded from PROP-2026-0004 by Founder decision of 2026-09-20; SF-REQ-030 is the canonical owner of Execution Evidence Derivation and Consistency Verification.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",1012,1020]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-031\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"a1893a980b7a214e7b048b108aedfe06e33ce915ebe5cec3efa73d91b1489e8f\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P4 Improve routing recommendations from observed task/provider/model outcomes while remaining task/model/version aware.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",1036,1040]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/