ly executes work until the eligible backlog is exhausted, blocked, or requires human authority. No human per-BIU trigger.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",842,846]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-002\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"973c5bf491dc76e8cb23ed6651dbe45a064547513f4a13f7fdfd559e55be71bd\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 Select next eligible READY BIU by external priority, then FIFO among equals/unprioritized, subject to dependencies and WIP. AlienIntent never invents product priority. Amendment (2026-09-21, [SWF-21 release admission](2026-09-20-wave1-release-coordinator.md)) \\u2014 admission preconditions. Eligibility selects which BIU is next; admission decides whether it may enter IMPLEMENT at all. Before any READY/TASKS \\u2192 IMPLEMENT release, and before any worker is launched, all of the following must hold, mechanically where possible: 1. implementation is explicitly authorized by a durable release record; 2. that record identifies the exact baseline revision; 3. the baseline resolves to a real repository revision; 4. the baseline is compatible with \\u2014 reachable from \\u2014 the intended release point as policy requires; 5. stale Issue wording stating that implementation is unauthorized cannot coexist with an authorized release without an explicit superseding record; 6. no worker is launched until these checks pass. A failed check is a refusal to transition, not a warning. This does not replace Agent-Ready or the dependency/WIP conditions; it is the record-completeness gate in front of them. Dependency satisfaction is a lifecycle question ([SWF-31](2026-09-20-wave1-closure-policy.md)). The bootstrap evaluates it through GitHub's native blocked-by links, which read Issue state \\u2014 a projection the control plane writes to, not lifecycle authority. Project DONE is the authoritative state. Canonical Python must evaluate dependency satisfaction against lifecycle state it owns, never against a secondary projection that can lag or be edited externally.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",847,864]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-003\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"bad3e0175a436878725a1864c7f4b402f96d14b9a51a06eb95a5ca559b4d9416\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 Support configurable concurrent work streams. Default one active mutating stream; independent work may run concurrently when policy allows.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",865,869]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-004\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"4937792d330596a33ff9f399b760333b18e6156c5f9aef3b847e3e0b88ab7ace\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 When capacity opens, automatically select/release the next eligible READY BIU.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",870,874]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-005\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"6bbdeaf197831f6bd43fb1c3980336df6bdda67dc5cbf8cd61661e1f93724e32\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 Read upstream work, priority, and dependencies through a Work Management port. GitHub Projects is the first adapter; the core does not depend on GitHub concepts.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",875,879]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-006\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"1a39f49de46bac5be70f920f180a7d6aee4af33f510bd31c8e423e93a87ed2a5\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 When authority is missing, emit a structured HumanDecisionRequired event and block only affected work. Independent work continues.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",880,884]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-007\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"edd23bd5befe289a47b2cadddd1b72d13ded45ce4fed09314107949341f8cd29\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 Never enter VERIFY until the exact candidate is durably identifiable and retrievable by a fresh independent verifier. Enforce in the control plane, not worker instructions. Amendment (2026-09-20, [SWF-30](2026-09-20-candidate-worktree-retention.md)) \\u2014 local working copy as operational cache. Custody is satisfied by the durable published identity, not by the local working copy that produced it. A local candidate worktree is therefore not itself required evidence once all of: (1) the exact candidate identity is known; (2) the candidate commit/artifact is durably published; (3) that identity is independently retrievable; (4) read-back confirms the published identity/content; (5) no active invocation uses the worktree; (6) no uncommitted unique content exists; (7) no explicit BIU or evidence policy requires local retention. When all seven hold, the worktree is operational cache and may be removed as routine cleanup. \\\"Durably published\\\" means the candidate remains reachable through a remote reference or other repository object whose retention is at least as strong as the applicable evidence-retention obligation; a transient remote branch about to be deleted does not qualify merely because the commit currently exists on the remote. Failing any condition means retention. This amendment does not weaken conditions 1\\u20134 \\u2014 it consumes that proof \\u2014 and it never authorizes deleting the only durable copy of anything, nor any evidence object, trajectory or accepted result. Architecture Authority \\u00a726 evidence retention is cross-referenced and unchanged.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",885,893]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-008\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"3d31a31a7b2eef4f38bbfbe31c5338fca6b06cca3aca3e09eeb69a10d922f4f5\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 Preserve canonical execution state across crashes/restarts and prevent duplicate effects using the approved inbox/effect-intent/outbox, version, fencing, idempotency, and reconciliation model.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",894,898]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[\"SF-REQ-024\",\"SF-REQ-029\",\"SF-REQ-034\",\"SF-REQ-049\",\"SF-REQ-052\"],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-009\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"6fbad5fedc4c8c38d09b5d0ad010157001401cbb7a3e60ad58a5ceafbfa4abdc\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 Lifecycle, policy, reservations, WIP, retries, capabilities, budgets, candidate identity, and verdict admissibility are deterministic. No LLM owns canonical execution state. Amendment (2026-09-21, [SWF-32](2026-09-21-biu-execution-cycle-counter.md)) \\u2014 BIU execution cycle counter. The kernel maintains a durable per-BIU execution cycle number after release, deterministic and reconstructible like the candidate identity it sits beside. The first authoritative transition into IMPLEMENT establishes cycle 1; every later authoritative transition into IMPLEMENT from another lifecycle state \\u2014 including authorized ACCEPT \\u2192 IMPLEMENT rework \\u2014 increments by exactly one; VERIFY inherits the cycle and never increments it; ACCEPT/DONE retain it as history. Retry, restart, provider failover or a replacement worker within the same phase does not increment, a verifier restart within VERIFY does not increment, liveness recovery or replay of the same state does not increment, and duplicate delivery of one transition must not increment twice. Restart, replay and reconciliation preserve or deterministically reconstruct the same value. Cycle count is not invocation count. A cycle is a lifecycle fact; an invocation attempt is a worker fact; neither is derivable from the other. Worker invocations remain separately identifiable, and trajectory must represent BIU \\u2192 cycle \\u2192 invocation attempts. The cycle is projected to the configured Work Management provider for operator visibility (FD-01 direction only \\u2014 a projected field is never execution authority), and is evidence, not a verdict: SF-REQ-024, SF-REQ-029, SF-REQ-034, SF-REQ-049 and SF-REQ-052 consume it; none of them owns it. Not retrofitted. This adds no obligation to the Node bootstrap or to any released BIU, and carries no Priority or Wave assignment \\u2014 the implementation obligation is unscheduled until the Founder assigns one.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",899,909]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-010\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"81cd94a42eae5d4daa150c816208ebf948c774a756b4232aeff8628926866d2e\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P0 BIUs have machine-readable Intent, requirement links, fixed decisions, boundaries, dependencies, capabilities, budget, completion criteria, verification obligations, evidence obligations, non-goals, candidate custody, and release policy.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",910,914]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-011\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"434daec64c8c5dc208a9c0a9a16f4bd2eaa906b9f38a9f1e81247bf70d638daa\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P1 Represent authorized requirements independently of GitHub/Jira/document formats, with stable IDs, provenance, status, dependencies, and traceability to BIUs.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",915,919]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-012\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"486961fd0e31a662d00178923701ed0b853541f0174eb941362217464f92cec6\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P1 Detect missing authority or ambiguity before implementation and emit structured questions rather than allowing implementation agents to improvise.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",920,924]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-013\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"6e7897097802f9d63fa865f516f6bc8348e6965fcde070637895fb1603b98830\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P1 Lower governed requirements into bounded BIUs with explicit requirement-satisfaction links and dependency DAGs.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",925,929]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-014\",\"retired\":false,\"revision\":\"b030c0762a30a9effea9225ba35cd3fd33d85fe7ab5a9641f768fa6d849308cc\",\"role\":\"Observation\",\"satisfaction_links\":[],\"semantic\":\"Priority: P1 Where mechanically testable, derive verification/test obligations before implementation. Implementation code cannot be the sole source of its own acceptance tests.\",\"source_paths\":[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\"],\"source_spans\":[[\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",930,934]]},{\"authority_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"dependencies\":[],\"eligible\":false,\"provenance\":[{\"authority_status\":\"historical-observation\",\"external_identity\":\"docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"external_revision\":\"d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998\",\"external_source\":\"git\",\"ingestion_timestamp\":\"2026-09-23T00:00:00Z\",\"source_link\":\"git:d83e87e6f2bb4ff90ff4f4f0e3940582f8d5c998:docs/decisions/alienintent-software-factory-plan.md\",\"synchronization\":\"no-projection; regression-only\"}],\"requirement_id\":\"SF-REQ-015\",\"retired\":false,